    "description": "<p>Connection: @UUID[Compendium.ptr2e.core-moves.MBgMy5w6O5j5Ux9Q]{Stand Off}</p><p>The user may utilise the move @UUID[Compendium.ptr2e.core-moves.MBgMy5w6O5j5Ux9Q]{Stand Off} as a Free Action once per activation.</p><p>While the user possesses the @Affliction[duel] affliction:</p><p>The user's @Trait[contact] attacks gain @Trait[danger-close] vs their Duel Partner.</p><p>The user's @Trait[contact] attacks which lack the @Trait[x-strike] or @Trait[double-strike] traits gain +4 Critical Stages.</p><p>If the user has used a @Trait[set-up] attack's @Trait[set-up] phase, then if they are targeted by an attack before they are able to complete the Resolution phase, they may immediately resolve the @Trait[set-up] move as an @Trait[interrupt] action.</p>",
